flowchart LR
    U[User Request] --> API[API Gateway]
    API --> PLAN[Planner / Intent Classifier]
    PLAN --> RET[Retriever]
    RET --> VDB[Vector DB]
    VDB --> RERANK[Reranker]
    RERANK --> PROMPT[Prompt Builder]
    PROMPT --> ROUTER[LLM Router]
    ROUTER --> LLM[Model Call]
    LLM --> TOOLS[Tool Calls]
    TOOLS --> EVAL[Evaluator / Safety Layer]
    EVAL --> RESP[Response Generator]
    RESP --> USER[User Response]

    EVAL --> REPLAY[Decision Replay]
    TOOLS --> SYS[Systems of Record]
    PLAN --> MEM[Memory / Context Store]

    API -. R/O/C/S .-> PLAN
    RET -. R/O/C/S .-> VDB
    ROUTER -. R/O/C/S .-> LLM
    TOOLS -. R/O/C/S .-> SYS
